  "text": "Menu\nX-twitter\nThreads\nInstagram\nFacebook\nYoutube\nDONATE\nEndorsed by Governor Andy Beshear, former Lexington mayor Jim Gray, veterans, and teachers\n## Endorsements\nZach Dembo has been endorsed by the largest union in the country, national veterans organizations, teachers, the Lexington Herald-Leader, Kentucky leaders like Governor Andy Beshear, Rocky Adkins, and Lt. Governor Jacqueline Coleman.\n## Andy Beshear\n## Governor\n## Rocky Adkins\n## Senior Advisor to the Governor\n## Jacqueline Coleman\n## Lt. Governor\n## Jim Gray\n## Former Lexington Mayor & KY Transportation Secretary\n## Ben Chandler\n## Former Congressman, KY-06\n## Kerry Harvey\n## Former Secretary of the Kentucky Justice and Public Safety Cabinet\n## Mary Noble\n## Former Secretary of the Kentucky Justice and Public Safety Cabinet\n## Dr. Jay Box\n## Former President, Kentucky Community and Technical College System\n## National Leaders\n## Mark Kelly\n## U.S. Senator, Arizona\n## Pat Ryan\n## U.S. Representative, NY-18\n## Jason Crow\n## U.S. Representative, CO-6\n## Lauren Underwood\n## U.S. Representative, IL-14\n## Derek Tran\n## U.S. Representative, CA-45\n## Labor Unions & Organizazations\n## Committee to Protect Health Care\n## Lexington Herald-Leader\n## League of Conservation Voters\n## Kentucky State AFL-CIO\n## VoteVets\n## National Education Association\n## Serve America\n## New Politics\n## United Steelworkers\n## American Federation of Government Employees\n## New Dems Coalition\n## End Citizens United\n## Blue Dog Democrats\n## Hold The Line\n## Foreign Policy for America\n## Groundwork Project PAC\n## Next 50\n## Council for a Livable World\n## International Brotherhood of Electrical Workers\n## UAW Local 862\n## LiUNA Local 189\n## Bluegrass Labor Council\n## Association of Flight Attendants\n## Painters Union DC 6\n## UFCW 227\n## Brotherhood of Maintenance of Way Employees Division of the International Brotherhood of Teamsters\n## Alliance for Retired American